message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Semi-Automated Erythema Quantification Tool for Infantile Haemangioma Monitoring"
abstract: >
  A Python-based semi-automated tool for quantifying erythema from serial clinical
  photographs of infantile haemangioma using the erythema index (EI = [R-G]/[R+G+B])
  and additional colorimetric metrics. Developed and validated at the Department of
  Paediatric Surgery, All India Institute of Medical Sciences, New Delhi, India,
  in the context of a prospective photographic registry of infants receiving propranolol.
